OL,3,GNEWSA'We need more council tax to pay
OL,4,Afor our mistakes'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council leader has said another
OL,7,Fabove-threshold council tax rise will
OL,8,Flikely be imposed on residents next
OL,9,Fyear to "pay for the mistakes of the
OL,10,Fpast".
OL,12,FHeather Kidd's Liberal Democrat
OL,13,Fadministration on Shropshire Council
OL,14,Fdeclared a financial emergency last
OL,15,FSeptember, following years of the
OL,16,Fauthority battling to deliver balanced
OL,17,Fbudgets.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
