OL,3,GNEWSA'We need more council tax to pay
OL,4,Afor our mistakes'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn independent report has laid bare the
OL,7,Fcouncil's "extremely poor financial
OL,8,Fhealth," in part due to "a lack of
OL,9,Fadequate financial management" under
OL,10,FConservative leadership.
OL,12,FThe Chartered Institute of Public
OL,13,FFinance and Accountancy (CIPFA)
OL,14,Fundertook a review of the council in
OL,15,FMay following a request by the
OL,16,Fgovernment.
